#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:5
msgid "Heat Transfer"
msgstr "传热"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:7
msgid ""
"**Heat Transfer** is the question how hot a part gets, heated and cooled as "
"it is: a steady-state thermal analysis of the solid, reporting the "
"temperature through it. It is what says whether a heatsink is big enough."
msgstr ""
"**Heat Transfer** "
"问的是一个零件按它当前的加热和冷却方式会热到什么程度：对该实体做稳态热分析，并报告其中各处的温度。正是它说明一个散热器是否足够大。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:11
msgid ""
"The question is asked by a ``thermal:`` section on the part, a map of named "
"scenarios, and answered by a solver a package supplies. "
":doc:`/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis` explains what every analysis has "
"in common."
msgstr ""
"这个问题由零件上的一个 ``thermal:`` "
"小节提出，它是一个具名场景的映射，而由某个包所提供的求解器来回答。:doc:`/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis` "
"讲的是每一项分析的共同之处。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:17
msgid "What the scenario says"
msgstr "场景说明什么"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:19
msgid "Three conditions, each naming interfaces the part implements:"
msgstr "三个条件，每一个都指名零件所实现的接口："

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:21
msgid "``temperature:``"
msgstr "``temperature:``"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:22
msgid ""
"a temperature per interface type or named instance, in Celsius (``40 C``) --"
" the surface is held there."
msgstr "按接口类型或具名实例给出的一个温度，单位为摄氏度（ ``40 C`` ）-- 该表面被维持在那个温度。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:25
msgid "``heat:``"
msgstr "``heat:``"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:26
msgid "a power put in through the port's surface, in watts (``2 W``)."
msgstr "通过该端口表面输入的一个功率，单位为瓦（ ``2 W`` ）。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:28
msgid "``convection:``"
msgstr "``convection:``"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:29
msgid ""
"a film coefficient in W/(m²·K) -- that surface is cooled against the "
"ambient."
msgstr "一个以 W/(m²·K) 为单位的表面换热系数 -- 该表面对环境散热。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Every other surface is insulated.** A part that states only where heat "
"goes in is a part with nowhere for it to go, so each scenario has to say how"
" it leaves: held at a temperature, or cooled by a film."
msgstr ""
"**其他所有表面都是绝热的。** "
"一个只说明热量从哪里进来的零件，就是一个热量无处可去的零件，所以每个场景都必须说明它是怎么出去的：被维持在某个温度，或者通过表面换热被冷却。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:52
msgid "In the UI"
msgstr "在界面中"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:54
msgid ""
"The scenarios are listed down the left with the first selected, each marked "
"with how its last run went, and selecting one runs it. What is shown is the "
"temperature field over the model the implementation produced, with the "
"findings under it; **Analysed by** chooses the solver and **Analyse** runs "
"it again."
msgstr ""
"各个场景列在左侧，默认选中第一个，每一个都带着它上一次运行结果的标记，而选中某一个就会运行它。显示出来的是实现方所产出模型上的温度场，各项发现列在它下面；**Analysed"
" by** 用来选择求解器，而 **Analyse** 会再运行一次。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:59
msgid ""
"The Analysis group's Heat Transfer tab: the scenario list and the "
"temperature field"
msgstr "Analysis 组的 Heat Transfer 标签页：场景列表和温度场"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:64
msgid ""
"The tab is enabled for a part that declares ``thermal:`` and disabled for "
"everything else."
msgstr "这个标签页对声明了 ``thermal:`` 的零件启用，而对其他一切都禁用。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:68
msgid "On the command line"
msgstr "在命令行中"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:78
msgid "Who runs it"
msgstr "由谁来运行它"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:80
msgid ""
"The default is `partcad-cae-elmer <https://github.com/partcad/partcad-cae-"
"elmer>`_, which runs `Elmer <https://www.elmerfem.org/>`_; "
"``caeThermalImplementation`` names another. `Code_Aster <https://www.code-"
"aster.org/>`_ and `MOOSE <https://mooseframework.inl.gov/>`_ do this "
"analysis too."
msgstr ""
"默认是 `partcad-cae-elmer <https://github.com/partcad/partcad-cae-elmer>`_ ，它运行"
" `Elmer <https://www.elmerfem.org/>`_ ；``caeThermalImplementation`` "
"可以指名另一个。`Code_Aster <https://www.code-aster.org/>`_ 和 `MOOSE "
"<https://mooseframework.inl.gov/>`_ 也能做这项分析。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:87
msgid "An example"
msgstr "一个例子"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:89
msgid ""
"`examples/feature_cae "
"<https://github.com/partcad/partcad/tree/main/examples/feature_cae>`_ "
"declares ``cantilever``'s ``tip-heated`` scenario: the root held at 20 °C "
"and 1 W put in at the tip. The temperature the tip reaches is ``P·L/(k·A)``,"
" and the package's ``README.md`` prints what the solver measured beside it."
msgstr ""
"`examples/feature_cae "
"<https://github.com/partcad/partcad/tree/main/examples/feature_cae>`_ 声明了 "
"``cantilever`` 的 ``tip-heated`` 场景：根部被维持在 20 °C，而端部输入 1 W。端部所达到的温度为 "
"``P·L/(k·A)`` ，而该包的 ``README.md`` 会把求解器所测得的结果与它并列打印出来。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:95
msgid "Agent skills"
msgstr "智能体技能"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:97
msgid "``/pc:validate``"
msgstr "``/pc:validate``"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/analysis_thermal.rst:98
msgid ""
"Runs every scenario as part of giving each requirement a verdict, and "
"reports one that names a ``feature:`` as evidence for that feature."
msgstr "在给每一项需求下结论的过程中运行每一个场景，并把指名了某个 ``feature:`` 的场景作为该特性的证据来报告。"
